CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_Fork
├── when the factory is deployed against the real CCTP contracts
│   ├── it should deploy successfully
│   ├── it should reject an EOA tokenMessenger address
│   └── it should reject an EOA usdc address
├── when create is called on a real chain
│   ├── it should wire the module to the real TokenMessengerV2 and USDC
│   └── it should register the module in the factory
├── when createDeterministic is called on the fork
│   └── it should deploy to the predicted address
├── when a factory-deployed module bridges with a zero fee
│   ├── it should burn real USDC through the real TokenMessengerV2
│   └── it should leave no balance or messenger approval on the module
├── when a factory-deployed module bridges with a non-zero fee
│   ├── it should burn real USDC through the real TokenMessengerV2
│   ├── it should emit the computed maxFee in BridgeInitiated
│   ├── it should report an amountOut matching the estimate
│   ├── it should net the fee off the full balance in previewExecution
│   └── it should succeed on the hook path
├── when a factory-deployed module is offered a non-USDC token
│   └── it should reject it in validate
└── when two PaymentRails share the module
    └── it should bridge for both instances
